{"id":"683b99c35eac8971","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-ml-cr-strict.md","title":"可计算随机性严格弱于 ML 随机性","display":"thm-ml-cr-strict — 可计算随机性严格弱于 ML 随机性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-ml-cr-strict","aliases":["43-thm-ml-cr-strict"],"display":"thm-ml-cr-strict — 可计算随机性严格弱于 ML 随机性","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-comprandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.4 Theorem 10.4.7(ii)–(iii)、Theorem 10.4.8，印刷221–222，PDF241–242","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-ml-cr-strict"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-ml-cr-strict</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ml-cr-strict — 可计算随机性严格弱于 ML 随机性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.4 Theorem 10.4.7(ii)–(iii)、Theorem 10.4.8，印刷221–222，PDF241–242"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>随机性谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>高程度可提供这种分离；原书进一步证明可以选择left-c.e.实数。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.4 Theorem 10.4.7(ii)–(iii)、Theorem 10.4.8，印刷221–222，PDF241–242。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-comprandom","status":"resolved","id":"52fd5856a06d2543","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-comprandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"随机性谓词见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-comprandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-comprandom","status":"resolved","id":"52fd5856a06d2543","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"随机性谓词见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-comprandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-comprandom","status":"resolved","id":"52fd5856a06d2543","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-comprandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-comprandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1261,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-215","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-ml-cr-strict]] — 可计算随机性严格弱于 ML 随机性"}],"outgoing":["0586e0fd0301d605","52fd5856a06d2543"]}